# Large model files policy:
#  * tracked: the small simulated-data TerraFM checkpoints in artifacts/ckpt/*.pt and all result JSONs
#    (metrics*.json, metrics_real.json, bench_laptop.json) - they are the evidence behind the UI numbers.
#  * ignored: ONNX exports and real-data fine-tunes (foundation-model checkpoints are hundreds of MB each;
#    rebuild with train.bat / make_demo_bundle.bat, ship them inside dist/terrascope_demo.zip).
*.onnx
*.onnx.data
artifacts/onnx/
artifacts/ckpt/real/
# machine-specific
artifacts/pc_info.json
artifacts/dryrun/

